    "description": "Meet people from all over the world through HotTalk.\r\n\r\nSelect the person you want to chat with from the real-time connection list! All users are real users.\r\n\r\nLook at the profile picture and choose the person you want to chat with! Wouldn\u2019t it be nice to set up your profile too?\r\n\r\nSend not only text chat but also images, voice, and video.\r\n\r\nHot Talk supports various languages! Meet friends from different languages.\r\n\r\nIf you meet someone you like, add them to your favorites! It will be convenient the next time you talk.\r\n\r\nVIP Membership Benefits\r\n- Voice calls and video calls are possible.\r\n- Additional bonus points are given every day.\r\n- You can check which users have expressed interest in you.\r\n- Ads do not appear\r\n- You can search for friends\r\n- You can use gender filter",
